.TH HD-BASE 7 "October 2026" "hd-base" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-base \- the hyprdebian base system
.SH DESCRIPTION
The meta package
.B hd-base
depends on the packages that every hyprdebian system has, so that they are
installed with it and stay installed.
It installs no files of its own besides this man page, and configures
nothing: a package it pulls in is set up the way that package does it.
.SH PACKAGES
.TP
.B hyprdebian
.BR hd-network ,
the network configuration; see
.BR hd-network (7).
.TP
.B Remote access and firewall
.B openssh-server
and
.BR kitty-terminfo ,
so that the kitty terminal works over ssh;
.BR ufw ,
the firewall.
.TP
.B ZFS
.BR zfs-dkms ,
.B zfsutils-linux
and
.BR zfs-initramfs ;
.B build-essential
and
.B initramfs-tools
to build the ZFS module and the initrd.
.TP
.B Firmware and boot
.B firmware-linux
and
.BR firmware-qlogic ;
.B efibootmgr
for the boot entries of the firmware.
.TP
.B Console
.BR locales ,
.BR keyboard-configuration ,
.B console-setup
and
.BR ca-certificates .
.TP
.B System services
.BR systemd-resolved ,
name resolution, and
.BR rsyslog ,
logging.
.TP
.B Command line tools
.BR eza ,
.BR fzf ,
.BR nfs-common ,
.BR psmisc ,
.BR net-tools ,
.BR pciutils ,
.BR usbutils ,
.BR acpi ,
.BR bash-completion ,
.BR git ,
.BR git-delta ,
.BR ack ,
.BR command-not-found ,
.BR man-db ,
.B apt-file
and
.BR zram-tools .
.PP
.B firmware-linux
and
.B firmware-qlogic
are in the
.B non-free-firmware
component of Debian, which the apt sources must include.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hd-network (7)
.SH AUTHOR
Erik Van Hamme <erik.vanhamme@gmail.com>
